# Wix -> Astro redirect map.
#
# Every path here existed on the old Wix site (taken from its own pagesMap and
# dynamic-router config). Netlify serves a real file if one matches the request
# first, so these only fire for paths the new site does not build — that is why
# /electrician-brunswick and friends are absent: the slugs did not change.
#
# All 301 (permanent) so link equity transfers. Keep this file in public/ —
# Astro copies it into dist/ verbatim.

# --- Services -------------------------------------------------------------
# Wix kept these both as top-level pages and beneath /electrician-services,
# and both shapes are in the wild, so both are mapped.
